sequenceDiagram
    actor Retailer as "Retailer"
    actor Staff as "Admin/Operator"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant Blob as "evidenceStorage: External System"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Retailer->>UI: Report missing/damaged quantity with evidence
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/complaints
    API->>App: Validate order, shipment, batch, tag and ownership
    App->>Blob: Store evidence
    App->>DB: Create Pending complaint and disputed net value
    API-->>-UI: Complaint submitted
    Staff->>UI: Review complaint
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/complaints/{id}/resolve
    API->>App: Resolve(decision, quantity, reason)
    alt Approved
        App->>DB: Create capped financial adjustment at allocated net price
        opt Confirmed payments exceed adjusted amount
            App->>DB: Create PendingRefund obligation
        end
        API-->>-UI: Adjustment/refund obligation recorded
    else Rejected
        App->>DB: Restore disputed amount to collectible balance and audit
        API-->>UI: Complaint rejected
    end
    Note over App,DB: No automatic return stock restoration or bank refund



